# Memory tracker profile (27 Nov): with BOTS_DRAW_PROFILE=1 a line per stats window, "memory sync per frame", splits
# the time of requests that found an invalid page into the SDK's lock and page scan, MakeRangeValid (global lock,
# valid bits, write protection) and the upload copies, counts the page runs and pages uploaded, and the CPU's write
# faults with the pages they invalidated. Explosions upload ~700 single pages a frame; this shows whether the cost is
# the protection round trip (then: stop protecting pages the game rewrites every frame) or the copies (then: bigger
# runs). Patch 0108 (uploads past unchanged reads) was dropped: as many pass splits gone, no frame time saved.
